/**
\page page_sttriggerdata2007 StTriggerData2007

\brief Concrete StTriggerData implementation for STAR Run 7 (year 2007) trigger data.

\section sec2007_overview Overview

StTriggerData2007 is the concrete implementation of the StTriggerData abstract interface for
<b>STAR Run 7 (year 2007)</b> raw trigger data.  It wraps a \c TrgDataType2007 structure and
exposes its content through the common StTriggerData accessor API.

Compared to StTriggerData2005, Run 7 adds VPD, MTD (prototype), and FMS QT readout; it
also provides a full set of FMS DSM layer accessors.

\section sec2007_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
StObject
  └── StTriggerData          (abstract interface)
        └── StTriggerData2007
\endcode

\section sec2007_runyear Run Year
Run 7, calendar year 2007 &mdash; Au+Au collisions at &radic;s = 200 GeV.

\section sec2007_datamembers Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| mData  | TrgDataType2007* | Pointer to the raw Run 7 trigger bank in memory. |

\section sec2007_new New Compared to 2005

<b>VPD (Vertex Position Detector):</b>
- vpdADC(StBeamDirection eastwest, int pmt, int prepost=0)
- vpdTDC(StBeamDirection eastwest, int pmt, int prepost=0)
- vpdEarliestTDC(StBeamDirection eastwest, int prepost=0)
- vpdTimeDifference()

<b>MTD (Muon Telescope Detector, prototype):</b>
- mtdAtAddress(int address, int prepost=0)
- mtdAdc(StBeamDirection eastwest, int pmt, int prepost=0)
- mtdTdc(StBeamDirection eastwest, int pmt, int prepost=0)

<b>FMS (Forward Meson Spectrometer) QT readout:</b>
- nQTdata(int prepost=0)
- QTdata(int prepost=0)

<b>FMS DSM accessors:</b>
- getDsm_FMS(), getDsm01_FMS(), getDsm02_FMS(), getDsm1_FMS(), getDsm2_FMS()

getDsm0_BEMCE(), getDsm0_BEMCW(), and getDsm1_BEMC() return \c nullptr for this format.

\section sec2007_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEvent* event = static_cast<StEvent*>(GetInputDS("StEvent"));
const StTriggerData* trgData = event->triggerData();
if (trgData) {
    unsigned short vpdDT  = trgData->vpdTimeDifference();
    unsigned short mtdAdc = trgData->mtdAdc(west, 0, 0);
    unsigned short nFMS   = trgData->nQTdata(0);
}
\endcode

\see StTriggerData
\see StTriggerData2005
\see StTriggerData2008
*/
